#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:3
msgid ""
"Mattermost is published as an **Azure Marketplace** solution that "
"provisions a production-ready Mattermost stack in your own subscription "
"using Azure-managed services for compute, database, shared file storage, "
"and load balancing. This option is intended for organizations that want a"
" resilient Mattermost deployment they can scale and operate within their "
"existing Azure tenant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:6
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:8
msgid ""
"An active **Azure subscription** with the **Owner** or **Contributor** "
"role on the subscription (required to purchase and deploy Azure "
"Marketplace solutions), permission to create resource groups, and "
"permission to accept **Azure Marketplace** billing terms for the offer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:9
msgid ""
"Familiarity with the **Azure portal** (resource groups, networking, "
"virtual machines, and Application Gateway)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:10
msgid ""
"For multi-node deployments (more than one application instance), a valid "
"**Mattermost Enterprise license** file. The license is optional for "
"single-node deployments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:11
msgid "If you plan to enable **HTTPS** at deployment time:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:13
msgid "A **PFX (PKCS#12)** certificate bundle and its password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:14
msgid ""
"A **custom domain (FQDN)** that you will point to the Application Gateway"
" after deployment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:17
msgid "What gets deployed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:19
msgid ""
"The template provisions a self-contained, production-ready stack in the "
"resource group you select, including:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Virtual Machine Scale Set (Linux):** Runs Mattermost on Ubuntu Pro "
"24.04 LTS images published by Mattermost. Instance count and VM size are "
"driven by the scaling tier you choose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Application Gateway with public IP:** Acts as the entry point for "
"Mattermost traffic, with optional **HTTPS listener** (using your PFX "
"certificate) and HTTP-to-HTTPS redirection when HTTPS is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Azure Database for PostgreSQL Flexible Server:** Managed PostgreSQL "
"service that stores Mattermost data, with optional **same-zone** or "
"**zone-redundant** high availability, backup retention and geo-"
"redundancy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Azure Files (NFS) with private endpoint:** Shared storage for "
"Mattermost data (uploads, plugins, and other shared files), reachable "
"only from inside the virtual network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Virtual network and subnets:** A dedicated VNet for the deployment, "
"with separate subnets for the Application Gateway, the Mattermost "
"application instances, the database, and the storage private endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:26
msgid ""
"**NAT gateway:** Provides controlled outbound internet access for the "
"application instances (for example, to fetch packages and the Mattermost "
"configuration scripts)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/linux/deploy-azure-native-vm.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Private DNS zones:** Used to resolve the PostgreSQL Flexible Server and"
" Azure Files private endpoint from inside the VNet."
msgstr ""

