msgid ""
"**PostgreSQL compute SKU:** Memory-optimized Flexible Server SKU. "
"Defaults to the SKU recommended for your scaling tier; pick a SKU that is"
" supported in your region. Available choices are ``Standard_E2ds_v5``, "
"``Standard_E4ds_v5``, and ``Standard_E8ds_v5``."
